<main class="ai-shell">
  <header class="ai-topbar">
    <div class="ai-brand"><span class="ai-brand-mark">W<span>✦</span></span><span>widget_list <em>/ AI THEME</em></span></div>
    <span class="ai-topbar-note">RAILS 8.1.4 · THEME PREVIEW</span>
  </header>
  <section class="ai-hero" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
    <div class="ai-eyebrow"><span class="ai-status-dot"></span> INTELLIGENT INTERFACE SYSTEM / 002</div>
    <h1 id="demo-title">Query with <span>clarity.</span></h1>
    <p>Explore the same inventory through Active Record and Ransack. Open the search menu to build a filter, then watch the grid update.</p>
    <div class="ai-chips"><span>ACTIVE RECORD</span><span>RANSACK 5.0</span><span>LIVE FILTERS</span></div>
  </section>
  <nav class="ai-nav" aria-label="Example pages">
    <%= link_to 'Sequel grid', root_path %>
    <%= link_to 'Ransack grid', ransack_path, class: 'is-active', 'aria-current': 'page' %>
    <%= link_to 'Administration console', administration_path if Rails.env.development? || Rails.env.test? %>
  </nav>
  <section class="ai-panel" aria-label="Ransack inventory grid">
    <div class="ai-panel-intro"><div><span class="ai-section-index">02 / FILTERS</span><h2>Active Record + Ransack</h2></div><span class="ai-panel-hint">Try “Name contains Apple” ↗</span></div>
    <%= raw @output %>
  </section>
  <footer class="ai-footer"><span>WIDGET_LIST / AI THEME</span><span>DESIGNED FOR DATA THAT MOVES</span></footer>
</main>
